* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_objinv (reference/crafted.toml, 8 Nov 2026): investment cases
* and decommissioning (eqobjinv.mod L52-274; M1.3 change 25-1, docs/m13-plan.md) added to
* TIMES_Demo demo12 (etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo @ 962db86, CC BY 4.0). No public suite model has
* investment case 2b or decommissioning costs:
* - ELCNNNUC01 (REG1): decommissioning cost, lifetime and lag (NCAP_DCOST, NCAP_DLIFE,
*   NCAP_DLAG), so OBJ_SUMS3, the decommissioning spreads (INVSPRED with the '0' header,
*   OBJ_SUMIII) and OBJ_DIVIII; and its own discount rate (NCAP_DRATE, COR_SALVI).
* - ELCREHYD00 (both regions, past investments): decommissioning cost and lifetime.
* - ELCRNSOL01: a 6-year technical life, so investments repeat within the longer periods
*   (COEF_RPTI > 1, case 1b, the FOR loop of L155); in REG2 also a 2-year lead time
*   (NCAP_ILED), case 2b (L198-214) with interest during construction (L219-229).
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
PARAMETER
NCAP_DCOST ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCNNNUC01.MEuro05 400
REG1.2005.ELCREHYD00.MEuro05 50
REG2.2005.ELCREHYD00.MEuro05 50
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_DLIFE ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCNNNUC01 5
REG1.2005.ELCREHYD00 3
REG2.2005.ELCREHYD00 3
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_DLAG ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCNNNUC01 2
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_DRATE ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCNNNUC01 0.08
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_TLIFE ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCRNSOL01 6
REG2.2005.ELCRNSOL01 6
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_ILED ' '/
REG2.2005.ELCRNSOL01 2
/
